sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    opt This step is optional
        CSMS->>CS: GetLocalListVersionRequest
        CS-->>CSMS: GetLocalListVersionResponse (versionNumber = 1)
    end

    CSMS->>CS: SendLocalListRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: SendLocalListRequest<br>- updateType Full<br>- versionNumber bigger than 0<br>- localAuthorizationList not empty<br>- localAuthorizationList[n].idTokenInfo not empty
    CS-->>CSMS: SendLocalListResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Note: If the Local Authorization List is too big for one message, step 1 and 2 will be repeated
